## Command

```shell
biome migrate stylelint --include-inspired --include-nursery
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{ "linter": { "enabled": true } }
```

## `.stylelintrc.json`

```json
{
        "rules": {
            "max-nesting-depth": [5, { "ignoreAtRules": "supports" }]
        },
        "overrides": [
            {
                "files": ["*.scss"],
                "rules": {
                    "max-nesting-depth": [
                        2,
                        { "severity": "warning", "ignoreAtRules": ["media", "/^my-/", "/^x/i"] }
                    ]
                }
            }
        ]
    }
```

